							"pending",
							"delivered",
							"settled",
							"failed",
							"expired"
						],
						"description": "Your messages go `pending` → `delivered` → `settled` once the agent replies. A message that isn't delivered within 24 hours becomes `expired`; one that's delivered but never answered becomes `failed`. Agent messages are always `settled`."
